# 7. Infinite Canvas

## 7.1 Canvas dimensions

Virtual workspace:

- width: 6000 px;
- height: 5000 px.

Viewport zoom:

- minimum: 30%;
- maximum: 250%.

## 7.2 Pan

Pointer-drag on empty canvas moves the viewport.

Canvas panning must not accidentally:

- select a board;
- move a board;
- update project data;
- trigger unnecessary persistence.

Pointer capture should be used while dragging.

## 7.3 Zoom

Zoom should be cursor-centered.

The world point beneath the cursor must remain spatially stable while zoom changes.

## 7.4 Navigation controls

Floating controls:

- Zoom In;
- Zoom Out;
- Reset View.

## 7.5 Board positioning

Board positions are stored in world coordinates, not screen coordinates.

