# 8. Board Window System

Each board is represented by a `BoardWindow`.

## 8.1 Required properties

```ts
type BoardWindowState = {
  id: string
  boardType: BoardType
  x: number
  y: number
  width: number
  height: number
  minimized: boolean
  zIndex: number
}
```

## 8.2 Interaction

Supported:

- drag;
- focus;
- minimize;
- restore;
- shortcut focus;
- z-index promotion.

## 8.3 Focus

Clicking a board promotes it to the active z-index.

Active boards receive the visual focus treatment.

## 8.4 Minimize

Minimization changes presentation state only.

It must not destroy board data.

