# 10. SCRIPT-BOARD — Fountain

## 10.1 Editor

Must support a Fountain-compatible authoring experience.

## 10.2 Parser

Parser identifies:

- scene headings;
- action;
- character cues;
- dialogue;
- parentheticals;
- blank lines.

The supplied implementation describes semantic classification based on line structure, capitalization, indentation and context.

## 10.3 Modes

- Edit;
- Preview.

## 10.4 Structured extraction

Parsed screenplay content may populate:

- scenes;
- characters;
- dialogue;
- action;
- initial shot candidates.

Parsing must not overwrite existing authored data without explicit user confirmation.

