## 11.2 Prompt Lock

Prompt Lock is the canonical visual continuity descriptor.

It is used by Prompt Studio and Shot generation.

The UI must distinguish:

- missing lock;
- manually authored lock;
- AI-generated lock;
- locked/approved state.

