# 15. PROMPT-BOARD — Prompt Studio

Prompt Studio is the application’s prompt compiler.

## 15.1 Inputs

A compiled prompt may combine:

- shot type;
- lens;
- movement;
- action;
- character Prompt Lock;
- environment Env Lock;
- depth configuration;
- aspect ratio;
- platform;
- visual style;
- optional notes.

## 15.2 Conceptual compilation

```text
/{shotType} shot,
lens {lens},
{movement} camera.

{promptLock}

{envLock}

Action: {action}

--ar {aspectRatio}
--style raw
```

The exact syntax must be platform-aware.

## 15.3 Platforms

The compiler should expose a provider/platform adapter model rather than hard-coding one syntax.

