# 16. Shot Model

Shots are the principal production unit.

```ts
type Shot = {
  id: string
  sceneId: string
  frameId?: string
  characterId?: string
  environmentId?: string
  depthCellId?: string
  shotType: ShotType
  lens: Lens
  movement: CameraMovement
  duration: number
  action: string
  dialogue?: string
  notes?: string
  compiledPrompt?: string
}
```

A shot can therefore establish a complete relationship:

```text
SHOT
 ├── Scene
 ├── Character
 ├── Environment
 ├── Depth
 ├── Camera
 ├── Action
 └── Prompt
```

