# 18. Timeline

## 18.1 Timeline calculation

Total duration:

```text
totalDuration = Σ frame.duration
```

Frame segment width is proportional to duration.

## 18.2 Playhead

Playhead position is derived from:

```text
progress = currentTime / totalDuration
```

## 18.3 Interaction

Must support:

- play;
- pause;
- stop;
- seek;
- click timeline;
- frame selection.

## 18.4 Playback

Use `requestAnimationFrame` for smooth playback.

Playback must not continuously create heavyweight React state updates if direct rendering can safely be used.

