## 21.1 Supported formats

The supplied development extraction indicates support for:

- TXT;
- MD;
- JSON;
- CSV;
- HTML;
- Fountain;
- Seedance project files.

## 21.2 Ingestion pipeline

```text
File
 ↓
Read
 ↓
Normalize
 ↓
Preserve Source
 ↓
Classify Format
 ↓
Parse
 ↓
Extract Structured Data
 ↓
User Review
 ↓
Commit to Project State
```

## 21.3 Source preservation

The original document must remain available inside the project as a source artifact.

This enables:

- traceability;
- re-analysis;
- auditing;
- regeneration;
- comparison.

## 21.4 AI extraction

AI extraction must explicitly distinguish:

- source fact;
- structured inference;
- unresolved ambiguity.

No fabricated detail should be silently promoted to canonical production data.

