# 23. AI Safety and Continuity Rules

Every AI operation must receive explicit context.

AI must not infer continuity from isolated text when canonical entities already exist.

Priority:

```text
Canonical Project State
        >
Approved Lock
        >
User-authored notes
        >
Parsed source
        >
AI inference
```

AI-generated content must be marked as generated until accepted.

