# 25. History / Undo / Redo

Major mutations must be snapshot-aware.

Supported:

- Undo;
- Redo;
- mutation grouping where appropriate.

Examples of undoable mutations:

- add frame;
- delete frame;
- edit frame;
- move frame;
- edit character;
- edit environment;
- change camera;
- change lock;
- modify scene;
- import/commit source analysis.

Viewport movement should not pollute project history.

