- [ ] save works;
- [ ] load works;
- [ ] `.seedance` is portable;
- [ ] schema version exists.

### Export

- [ ] JSON;
- [ ] `.seedance`;
- [ ] CSV;
- [ ] PDF/print.

### Bible

- [ ] characters included;
- [ ] environments included;
