# 43. Final Product Model

The final Seedance Forge should be understood as:

```text
                    SOURCE MATERIAL
                          │
                          ▼
                    INGESTION ENGINE
                          │
                          ▼
                    PROJECT STATE
                          │
          ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
          ▼               ▼                ▼
       NARRATIVE       IDENTITY         WORLD
       SCRIPT          CHARACTERS       ENVIRONMENTS
          │               │                │
          └───────────────┼────────────────┘
                          ▼
                       SHOTS
                          │
             ┌────────────┼────────────┐
             ▼            ▼            ▼
           CAMERA       DEPTH        PROMPT
             │            │            │
             └────────────┼────────────┘
                          ▼
                  PRODUCTION OUTPUT
                   │       │       │
                   ▼       ▼       ▼
                ANIMATIC  BIBLE   SET PDF
```

The fundamental architectural idea is therefore:

> **Seedance Forge is a continuity engine for cinematic pre-production, with the canvas acting as the spatial workspace and the project state acting as the production source of truth.**
